The idea behind this prompt is to generate 10 different styles for a website, or for a blog post, or for a README.md file. It should include enough information to cover the styling requirements of font selection, color contrasting, different themed pictures generated from SVG, cool, warm, techno, 80 style, modern, business dashboard, personal whimsical, you get the idea. then as a user from the prompt I can copy paste the instructions to pass to the next agent to build the artifact whether its a full tailwind css styling guide, or a simple README.md instructions, or a blog post.
